# Veripsa release gate (auto-discovered). One gate per file -> two PRs adding gates add two FILES, never a
# shared line -> no false merge conflict on registration. register_gate is defined in run_gates.sh.
# Format: register_gate <test> <marker> <name> <ok_blurb> <desc> [tail]
# NOTE: NO backticks and NO dollar-sign in the desc/blurb text below (shell-eval fragility -- see CLAUDE.md).
register_gate "tests/test_render_inject_ack.py" "RENDER INJECT/ACK GATE: PASS" "render inject/ack (branch-name HTML injection neutralized at all sites + acked comment no longer leads with the stale pause headline + ack-evasion via a failed prior-read closed)" "render inject/ack: three VERIFIED customer-surface render-correctness bugs in github-app/render.py. RENDER-only -- no verdict/engine change, content-free, never-crash -- proven PURE/offline on the REAL render functions (render_pr_check / apply_pause_ack / watching_check / quota_paused_comment_body / cleared_comment_body are stateless over a main_impact_surface dict; no Postgres, no network). (A) HTML/MARKDOWN INJECTION via the BRANCH NAME: git check-ref-format ACCEPTS angle brackets, ampersand, the backtick and more, so a repo whose default branch carries a code-span-closing payload could, when the branch was interpolated RAW into the inline-code markdown (the branch-in-backticks form), CLOSE the one-backtick span and emit raw HTML (GitHub renders HTML in PR comments). Every OTHER customer string was already sanitized via the code/safe helpers; the branch slipped through at FIVE sites -- watching_check summary, quota_paused_comment_body, both cleared_comment_body spans, and the no-reservation check TITLE + SUMMARY. FIX: wrap branch in the code helper (code context) or the safe helper (the non-code check title) at ALL five sites. The gate verifies the code helper output is a balanced backtick fence whose inner backtick runs are strictly shorter (CommonMark: it cannot break out), the no-reservation title HTML-escapes the angle brackets, and the angle-bracket payload never appears OUTSIDE a fenced span in ANY affected body -- while a benign branch (main) still renders byte-identically. (B) STALE WAIT-IN-LINE HEADLINE on an ACKNOWLEDGED PR: the acknowledged branch of apply_pause_ack kept the base render bold headline (the serialize lead Wait in line -- a direct collision is ahead) at the TOP and only appended the acknowledged note at the BOTTOM, so an acked PR comment LED with the pause headline while the check had flipped to neutral/Acknowledged = self-contradictory. FIX: rewrite ONLY the headline line (the bold line at index 1) to an Acknowledged headline; the reserves line + the Land in order collision body STAY (still useful). Gate proves the acked comment first bold line is the Acknowledged headline NOT Wait in line, the stale pause lead is gone, the collision detail is kept, and the ack note survives. (C) ACK-EVASION via a FAILED prior-read: on the unreadable-prior fail-safe (the prior-comment read THREW this event so prior_hash is None and prior_confirmed is False) the marker stamped the NEW (possibly-CHANGED) snapshot into the comment, so the NEXT event saw prior == current snapshot, hit proven-match, and went acknowledged for a coupling that was NEVER re-acked. FIX: on the kept-but-unconfirmed case embed the PRIOR hash (empty string when the read failed), so the next event re-verifies and re-pauses the changed coupling. Gate drives the full chain (ack -> coupling materially changes -> event with a failed prior read -> next event) and proves the next event re-pauses (action_required) NOT acknowledged -- AND that the legitimate empty-recompute keep (snapshot recomputed empty, prior_hash present) STILL keeps the ack and preserves the prior hash, and that the normal proven-match / fresh-pause / proven-stale paths are unchanged (no recall regression -- no real pause weakened). Keeps the no-jargon, pause-comment-wording and render-honesty gates green" "render inject/ack: the branch name can no longer inject HTML or break a code span on any customer surface (five sites wrapped in the code/safe helper, a benign branch unchanged); an acknowledged PR comment leads with an Acknowledged headline instead of a stale Wait-in-line pause lead while keeping the collision detail; and an ack can no longer be evaded by a changed coupling whose prior read failed (the next event re-pauses rather than auto-matching), with the legitimate fail-safe keep and the normal ack paths unchanged. RENDER only, content-free, verdict + pause mechanism unchanged" 24
